WEBVTT

00:01.640 --> 00:05.800
（Tl Note: The small sign on the top left says "Sake."）

00:01.640 --> 00:05.800
（Mom and Pop Confectionery Store）

00:07.130 --> 00:08.360
Hello?

00:16.630 --> 00:19.130
Ah, w-welcome.

00:19.530 --> 00:21.780
Hmm, you work at this store?

00:22.230 --> 00:23.490
Y-Yes.

00:25.030 --> 00:26.060
That's right.

00:26.530 --> 00:31.380
Well, please give me a bottle of Lamune. I'm so thirsty.

00:32.330 --> 00:32.930
Okay.

00:36.430 --> 00:39.730
Hey, did this store just recently open?

00:39.830 --> 00:40.890
Ah... yes.

00:41.430 --> 00:43.660
No wonder I've never seen this store before.

00:46.330 --> 00:47.230
Thank you.

01:01.080 --> 01:03.350
If that girl sees that, she'll be surprised for sure.

01:03.360 --> 01:04.420
What?

01:04.430 --> 01:09.790
N-No, well, where did you buy that fish?

01:12.110 --> 01:13.780
This hairpin?

01:14.430 --> 01:17.350
Well, I don't quite remember.

01:17.530 --> 01:18.560
I see.

01:18.930 --> 01:21.300
I'm sorry.

01:22.130 --> 01:24.180
No, you don't have to apologize.

01:27.240 --> 01:30.020
Well, if it's possible...

01:32.130 --> 01:35.770
No, that's not good.

01:36.030 --> 01:40.480
No, it's all right, I was planning on cutting my hair.

01:46.530 --> 01:48.420
I'll trade you for this.

01:49.030 --> 01:49.850
But...

01:50.130 --> 01:52.400
Otherwise I won't accept it.

02:02.140 --> 02:07.550
Actually, I... just... moved here...

02:08.530 --> 02:10.620
Just like I had thought.

02:10.670 --> 02:16.570
Well, so... I don't have any friends here...

02:16.830 --> 02:19.990
So... well... if it's possible...

02:21.230 --> 02:23.360
Ken-chan...

02:25.330 --> 02:29.920
What's wrong with you? Didn't you go back already?

02:31.230 --> 02:34.540
I was planning to go back home alone, but I got lost.

02:34.930 --> 02:37.920
Geez, I don't know what to say to you.

02:38.340 --> 02:39.210
See you.

02:39.430 --> 02:41.180
Sure, see you later.

02:43.430 --> 02:44.880
Let's go home.

03:02.530 --> 03:07.230
The Distance Between the Two and the Lamune Bottle

03:14.830 --> 03:16.200
Welcome back.

03:16.830 --> 03:19.120
How was it, the field trip?

03:19.480 --> 03:21.220
It was pretty fun.

03:21.430 --> 03:23.620
I see, that's great.

03:24.230 --> 03:27.130
After all, this will be your last field trip here.

03:59.830 --> 04:02.830
Sakura-san? Where's Tae-senpai?

04:05.930 --> 04:08.160
Well, I'm really sorry.

04:08.230 --> 04:09.860
I asked you to come here all of a sudden.

04:10.470 --> 04:13.530
Ah, no. That's alright.

04:14.730 --> 04:16.520
But, where's Tae-senpai?

04:16.630 --> 04:18.830
Well... I...

04:18.930 --> 04:27.440
I have something I want to tell you, Tomosaka-senpai.
That's why I asked Tae-senpai to invite you to come here.

04:28.830 --> 04:31.190
I'm here to make this confession without thinking about anything else.

04:31.330 --> 04:38.020
I... Sakura Hiromi, like you, Tomosaka-senpai.

04:41.330 --> 04:43.910
I don't think you remember.

04:44.530 --> 04:49.490
I started liking you ever since the first time I saw you.

04:52.830 --> 04:55.690
But, I know.

04:56.530 --> 04:57.940
It's impossible.

04:58.230 --> 05:01.040
But I still wanted to tell you.

05:04.730 --> 05:08.460
I... I'll be moving away from here.

05:12.030 --> 05:14.510
But, oh well... This will be okay.

05:15.430 --> 05:20.090
No, w-wait, Sakura.

05:21.130 --> 05:24.890
No, this is enough.

05:30.530 --> 05:33.530
Good, this will be enough, right?

05:38.360 --> 05:40.700
The long summer vacation is here,

05:40.830 --> 05:44.300
but what is this long vacation for?

05:44.630 --> 05:51.460
Is it to stay home and avoid the heat? Please don't forget this vacation is meant for you all to study hard at home.

05:52.530 --> 05:56.700
Especially the third year students, you all have to do your best during this time...

06:02.030 --> 06:05.940
Great! Summer vacation has finally started!

06:06.030 --> 06:09.160
I can come here and see Hikari-chan everyday now.

06:09.230 --> 06:12.110
You don't know how anxiously I was waiting for this day to come.

06:15.430 --> 06:18.020
Anyway, what's up with your report card?

06:18.530 --> 06:20.260
All these red marks with scores of 1 and 2...

06:20.430 --> 06:23.270
But his P.E. grade is a 5.

06:20.430 --> 06:26.210
(Tl Note: In the Japanese grading. 5 is highest, 3 is passing, 1 or 2 is failing.)

06:23.530 --> 06:26.120
That's so pitiful.

06:26.430 --> 06:28.620
In another way, I guess we should respect him.

06:28.830 --> 06:32.500
Don't praise me, or I'll get shy.

06:32.970 --> 06:34.320
We didn't.

06:37.330 --> 06:40.860
Maybe she's getting ready to move.

06:40.890 --> 06:41.680
Yeah...

06:46.530 --> 06:49.580
What's up? You two don't seem well.

06:50.030 --> 06:52.410
T-That's not true.

06:52.630 --> 06:55.090
By the way, it's really hot. Get away from me.

06:55.530 --> 06:57.190
Is it because of Sakura-san?

07:02.030 --> 07:06.870
Even though I can see it from your expressions, what do you want to do?

07:07.230 --> 07:10.720
Do something only you can do for Sakura-san.

07:10.730 --> 07:13.770
Otherwise, you'll surely regret it.

07:16.110 --> 07:19.770
Geez, you're making me hesitate. Get going, you two.

07:29.630 --> 07:30.660
Senpai...

07:33.130 --> 07:35.040
Guys.

07:37.130 --> 07:41.080
W-Well, we thought it would be faster to come here and help out.

07:41.230 --> 07:42.450
B-But...

07:42.930 --> 07:45.970
Well, where do I put this?

07:46.230 --> 07:48.390
Well... this...

07:48.630 --> 07:52.930
Hurry up, I can't hold this forever.

07:54.030 --> 07:56.930
Well, this goes into storage first.

07:57.130 --> 08:00.350
The moving company will move it tomorrow.

08:00.430 --> 08:01.430
Okay.

08:03.230 --> 08:06.070
All right, let's do it!

08:06.330 --> 08:07.670
Yeah!

08:32.330 --> 08:36.060
Could you please help me move this desk downstairs?

08:36.330 --> 08:37.730
Sure.

08:38.730 --> 08:40.090
One, two...

08:43.430 --> 08:45.050
Hey, hold it up.

09:04.930 --> 09:05.650
Um...

09:06.330 --> 09:07.880
Hey, at least hold it.

09:12.030 --> 09:16.080
S-Sorry, was it really important to you?

09:16.710 --> 09:17.960
Hey...

09:18.930 --> 09:21.980
Not really, don't worry.

09:22.630 --> 09:24.640
It's just an empty bottle.

09:24.930 --> 09:26.030
R-Really?

09:26.130 --> 09:29.710
Don't worry, never mind.

09:42.530 --> 09:45.270
I don't know how I should thank you.

09:45.300 --> 09:47.110
No, you're welcome.

09:47.130 --> 09:49.130
If that accident didn't happen...

09:49.530 --> 09:50.660
Sorry.

09:51.030 --> 09:56.350
Don't be so down, Hatano-senpai. It was really nothing.

09:56.630 --> 10:01.410
And yeah, thank you very much for helping us out. I really appreciate it.

10:02.630 --> 10:06.060
Wait, it's not finished yet.

10:06.630 --> 10:08.400
Right? Nanami, Kenji.

10:09.030 --> 10:11.740
Can you come to Nanami's store later?

10:14.930 --> 10:16.470
You have to come.

10:21.660 --> 10:22.320
Sure.

10:42.190 --> 10:47.070
If... God could let me choose to return to a time of my choice...

10:47.470 --> 10:50.370
I'd certainly choose that time.

10:51.760 --> 10:54.520
If you'd like,

10:56.800 --> 10:59.010
we could be friends.

11:23.220 --> 11:25.780
You don't need to come so anxiously!

11:26.750 --> 11:29.060
What if you got in an accident on the way?

11:29.450 --> 11:30.270
That's because...

11:31.100 --> 11:33.430
I wanted to see you soon.

11:33.430 --> 11:43.540
Hey!

11:43.540 --> 11:45.810
Sakura, this way, over here!

11:51.830 --> 11:55.680
Well, is this okay... like this?

11:57.730 --> 12:02.630
Don't worry, I asked my mom to lend us the store.

12:02.930 --> 12:04.290
Huh, no way.

12:05.430 --> 12:08.700
It's okay to be like this sometimes. Don't worry.

12:09.230 --> 12:10.960
Hurry up and sit down, Sakura.

12:11.330 --> 12:13.100
Yeah, hurry up.

12:15.530 --> 12:17.280
Well, hmm...

12:19.130 --> 12:21.220
That's all right, isn't it?

12:24.930 --> 12:30.200
I don't want to make this atmosphere so intense. Let's have some fun today, okay?

12:31.730 --> 12:32.410
Okay.

12:35.730 --> 12:37.010
Well, let's have a toast first.

12:37.700 --> 12:38.800
Cheers!

12:38.830 --> 12:40.660
Cheers!

12:40.690 --> 12:45.150
Sakura-san, everybody, don't be shy. Help yourself.

12:45.330 --> 12:47.430
Today is special service.

12:48.530 --> 12:50.140
Thank you very much.

12:50.230 --> 12:53.170
All right, I can eat whatever I want.

12:53.330 --> 12:55.300
You should behave yourself at least.

12:56.030 --> 12:57.770
Why me?

13:17.230 --> 13:19.370
What are you doing, you two idiots?

13:27.430 --> 13:29.370
Huh? You're going to give this to me?

13:29.430 --> 13:32.140
Yeah, it's only a signature board.

13:32.730 --> 13:34.560
Will you accept it?

13:35.530 --> 13:39.520
O-Of course. Thank you very much.

13:39.830 --> 13:41.830
I'll cherish it forever.

13:46.730 --> 13:49.080
Well, it's time to go.

13:50.130 --> 13:53.050
By the way, Sakura-san, let's go to my house, okay?

13:53.640 --> 13:54.830
It's a good chance.

14:03.330 --> 14:04.450
Okay, come in.

14:05.730 --> 14:07.360
Sit wherever you like.

14:09.930 --> 14:15.110
Well, I have something I want to give you.

14:20.030 --> 14:21.240
Open it up.

14:26.230 --> 14:28.120
Thank you, Tomosaka-san.

14:28.330 --> 14:31.030
Hey, write to me, okay?

14:31.530 --> 14:32.860
I'll write to you too.

14:33.780 --> 14:37.060
And... if you have a boyfriend, don't forget to tell me.

14:39.830 --> 14:42.980
Let's hope each of us will get a good boyfriend, okay?

14:50.930 --> 14:53.690
Hey, Suzuka, can you come here for a bit?

14:55.530 --> 14:56.620
What's up?

14:57.130 --> 14:58.340
Wait for me.

15:19.530 --> 15:23.700
Geez, when are you going to remember?

15:23.830 --> 15:24.770
Sorry.

15:45.030 --> 15:46.600
There's no way I could've competed with her.

15:55.330 --> 15:57.390
Well, take care.

15:57.630 --> 15:59.770
Hatano, please send her home.

15:59.930 --> 16:01.530
It's all on me.

16:01.830 --> 16:05.410
Well, I had a lot of fun today.

16:10.830 --> 16:12.630
Thank you very much.

16:24.530 --> 16:29.390
How come Tomosaka-senpai's and Konoe-senpai's rooms are so close?

16:29.630 --> 16:35.430
Huh? That's why they're so good for each other, because they're close.

16:35.630 --> 16:38.640
It takes me forty minutes to get there.

16:39.160 --> 16:41.220
Even riding a bicycle takes fifteen minutes.

16:43.030 --> 16:45.370
There's no way I can compete.

16:48.530 --> 16:54.250
All right, within these forty minutes,
I'll tell you all the dumb things I've ever done.

16:54.910 --> 16:58.490
Huh? That would be kinda troublesome.

16:58.630 --> 17:00.160
What do you mean?

17:47.560 --> 17:48.410
Yo.

17:48.530 --> 17:51.510
Ken-chan, you fixed your bike?

17:51.630 --> 17:53.740
Yeah, let's go.

17:53.930 --> 17:55.040
Where?

17:58.150 --> 17:59.700
Hold on tight.

18:05.430 --> 18:07.920
Huh, isn't it that way?

18:08.330 --> 18:11.630
All right, I have to go somewhere first.

18:18.430 --> 18:21.490
Line one will soon enter the station.

18:21.630 --> 18:25.570
It's dangerous, so please stay behind the yellow line.

18:42.930 --> 18:43.850
Sakura!

18:44.830 --> 18:46.100
Tomosaka-senpai.

18:51.040 --> 18:51.810
This is...?

18:52.630 --> 18:54.550
I want to give this to you.

18:57.530 --> 19:04.190
Thank you very much.
You really are nice to me, Tomosaka-senpai.

19:04.190 --> 19:05.780
Same to you, Konoe-senpai.

19:06.730 --> 19:11.750
D-Don't be like this. Cheer up, okay?

19:17.530 --> 19:18.770
Time's up.

19:20.630 --> 19:21.680
Take care.

19:25.030 --> 19:25.750
Yeah, well...

19:27.730 --> 19:30.730
I really wanted to be born as your neighbor.

19:31.930 --> 19:36.660
Within the distance of one meter from you, Senpai.

19:38.830 --> 19:44.450
Tomosaka-senpai, Konoe-senpai, you two are the best match.

19:45.230 --> 19:48.010
There's no way I can get between you two.

19:48.730 --> 19:52.440
Honestly, I really admire you, but...

19:53.070 --> 19:53.830
Sakura.

19:54.330 --> 19:56.780
But... but...

19:57.430 --> 20:01.020
You can't always think, "That's fine."

20:22.640 --> 20:24.150
They really are good friends of yours.

20:25.430 --> 20:28.730
No, they aren't friends, they're my senpai.

20:29.030 --> 20:30.500
Ah, I see.

20:31.730 --> 20:36.280
Yeah, very good senpai, really good.

21:01.980 --> 21:05.610
Good bye, Tomosaka-senpai.

21:24.860 --> 21:27.860
If I didn't call Ken-chan.

21:28.160 --> 21:31.270
If I could be honest to my feelings toward Tomosaka-senpai.

21:31.360 --> 21:34.860
Maybe our relationship would be different.

21:34.960 --> 21:40.430
(Tl Note: Kouhaipai is lower grade; Senpai is higher grade. They're completely opposite.)

21:34.960 --> 21:37.260
Not as kouhaipai, not as a childhood friend.

21:37.260 --> 21:40.430
But this can't be redone.

21:40.660 --> 21:42.110
Then we should cherish this time now...

21:42.260 --> 21:43.940
No regrets...

21:44.060 --> 21:45.310
Live on.

21:45.960 --> 21:49.670
Next episode of Lamune:
Folk Dance and Overlapping Hearts

